WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,480
It’s snowing and windy, but I don’t want to have a cold mouth because of your lies!

2
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:10,800
In the ten days since the end of the world, everyone has seen through the reality.

3
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:15,190
The neighborhood committee complained that it had no binding force at all and no one was following its rules.

4
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:22,080
The Gao family purchased Wuzi, a pack of instant noodles for 10,000 yuan, and mineral water for 5,000 yuan, whatever you get!

5
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:25,320
I have some food at home that I can sell to you.

6
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:32,060
Their supplies have long been exhausted, and they may not even be able to solve their daily problems in the future.

7
00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:36,080
However, if you are hungry every day, you probably won’t have much chance to excrete.

8
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:40,880
Zhang Yi, please open the door, we are really freezing to death!

9
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:48,670
For the sake of past friendship, have mercy on us!

10
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:52,630
It would be better if he froze to death. If his defenses were broken, there must be a weapon hidden on his body.

11
00:00:52,630 --> 00:00:55,070
They will attack as long as the door is opened, I will never be fooled.
